2113
01:23:00,404 --> 01:23:02,273
the vocal cords need to be stretched as well.

2114
01:23:02,274 --> 01:23:03,474
(The vocal cords need to be stretched as well.)

2115
01:23:04,314 --> 01:23:06,643
