2146
01:24:16,354 --> 01:24:17,823
They say that helps with the vocal cords.

2147
01:24:17,824 --> 01:24:19,324
I think it's the same principle.

2148
01:24:19,554 --> 01:24:21,394
- I think it cleared my throat. - Really?

2149
01:24:22,354 --> 01:24:23,923
- I think it cleared my throat. - It sounds nice.

2150
01:24:23,924 --> 01:24:25,563
(It sounds nice.)

2151
01:24:25,564 --> 01:24:27,293
- It sounds much better. - It really did.

2152
01:24:27,294 --> 01:24:28,594
- I sound better. - Right.

2153
01:24:29,364 --> 01:24:31,334
